<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>日本动漫番剧日报｜{{ report.date }}</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-page: #f4f1ea;
            --bg-card: #ffffff;
            --border: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            --shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07);
            --text-main: #1a1a1a;
            --text-muted: #6b7280;
            --accent: #7c3aed;
            --accent-2: #a78bfa;
            --accent-soft: rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.1);
            --up: #10b981;
            --down: #ef4444;
            --warn: #f59e0b;
            --gold: #b45309;
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; }
        html, body { padding: 0; }
        body {
            font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", "PingFang SC", "Noto Sans SC", sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(160deg, #f7f3ea 0%, #f1ede4 100%);
            color: var(--text-main);
            line-height: 1.7;
            padding: 28px;
        }
        .wrap { max-width: 1160px; margin: 0 auto; }

        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7c3aed 0%, #a855f7 55%, #6d28d9 100%);
            color: #fff;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 30px 34px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            margin-bottom: 26px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .hero::after {
            content: "🎬";
            position: absolute; right: 28px; bottom: -14px;
            font-size: 96px; opacity: .18; transform: rotate(-8deg);
        }
        .hero h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 27px; letter-spacing: .5px; }
        .hero p { margin: 0; opacity: .93; font-size: 14px; }
        .hero .meta { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 12px; opacity: .8; }

        .grid { display: grid; gap: 20px; }
        .col-2 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }

        .card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 22px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        }
        .card:hover { box-shadow: 0 14px 38px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); }
        .card h2 {
            margin: 0 0 16px;
            font-size: 17px; font-weight: 900;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
            padding-left: 12px;
            color: var(--text-main);
        }
        .card h3 { margin: 20px 0 12px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; }

        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
        th, td { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 11px 12px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
        th { background: #faf9f7; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; color: #444; border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e5e5; }
        tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
        tbody tr:hover { background: var(--accent-soft); }

        .rank {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 9px;
            background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--accent); font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px;
        }
        .rank.gold { background: rgba(245,158,11,.15); color: var(--gold); }
        .rank.silver { background: rgba(148,163,184,.18); color: #64748b; }
        .rank.bronze { background: rgba(180,83,9,.14); color: #92400e; }

        .badge { display: inline-block; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; white-space: nowrap; }
        .badge-up { background: #d1fae5; color: #065f46; }
        .badge-down { background: #fee2e2; color: #991b1b; }
        .badge-flat { background: #f1f5f9; color: #475569; }
        .badge-heat { background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--accent); }

        .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

        .stars { color: var(--gold); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1px; }
        .meta { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }

        .recommend {
            background: var(--accent-soft);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 13px;
        }
        .news-item { margin-bottom: 18px; padding-bottom: 14px; border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--border); }
        .news-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; margin-bottom: 0; }

        .quote {
            background: #fffbeb;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--gold);
            padding: 16px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
        .quote .line { font-style: italic; font-size: 15px; margin: 8px 0 6px; }
        .footer { margin-top: 26px; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; text-align: center; line-height: 2; }
        .tag { color: var(--accent); font-size: 12px; margin-right: 10px; }
        .studio-chip { display:inline-block; background:#f5f3ff; color:#6d28d9; border-radius:999px; padding:2px 10px; font-size:12px; margin:2px 4px 2px 0; }
        @media (max-width: 860px) { .col-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero">
        <h1>📺 日本动漫番剧日报｜{{ report.date }}</h1>
        <p>专业、简洁、高信息密度 · 每日 10 分钟掌握动漫圈核心动态</p>
        <div class="meta">{{ report.overview_note }}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid">
        <!-- 1. 新闻 -->
        <div class="card">
            <h2>📰 今日动漫圈重要新闻</h2>
            {% for item in report.news %}
            <div class="news-item">
                <div style="font-weight:700;font-size:15px">{{ item.title }}</div>
                <div class="meta" style="margin:4px 0">
                    {% for t in item.tags %}<span class="tag">#{{ t }}</span>{% endfor %}
                </div>
                <div>{{ item.content }}</div>
                <div class="meta" style="margin-top:6px">💡 影响：{{ item.impact }}</div>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>

        <!-- 2. 热度排行榜 -->
        <div class="card">
            <h2>🔥 本季新番热度排行榜 TOP10</h2>
            <table>
                <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>动画</th><th>类型</th><th>评分</th><th>热度</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                {% for row in report.ranking %}
                <tr>
                    <td><span class="rank {% if row.rank==1 %}gold{% elif row.rank==2 %}silver{% elif row.rank==3 %}bronze{% endif %}">{{ row.rank }}</span></td>
                    <td>
                        <b>{{ row.title }}</b>
                        <div class="meta">{{ row.studio }}{% if row.episodes %} · {{ row.episodes }}话{% endif %}</div>
                        {% if report.rank_reason.get(row.rank|string) %}
                        <div class="meta" style="margin-top:4px">{{ report.rank_reason.get(row.rank|string) }}</div>
                        {% endif %}
                    </td>
                    <td><span class="badge badge-flat">{{ row.genre }}</span></td>
                    <td><span class="num" style="font-weight:700">{{ row.score }}</span></td>
                    <td><span class="badge badge-heat">🔥 {{ row.heat }}</span>
                        <div class="meta" style="margin-top:2px">❤{{ row.favourites }} · 👁{{ row.popularity }}</div>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. 编辑推荐 -->
        <div class="card">
            <h2>✨ 今日编辑推荐</h2>
            <div class="recommend">
                <div style="font-weight:800;font-size:16px">{{ report.editor.title }}</div>
                <div class="meta" style="margin:6px 0">适合人群：{{ report.editor.audience }}</div>
                <div>{{ report.editor.reason }}</div>
                <div class="meta" style="margin-top:8px">类似作品：
                    {% for s in report.editor.similar %}<span class="tag">{{ s }}</span>{% endfor %}
                </div>
            </div>

            <h3>🌱 本周口碑黑马</h3>
            {% for item in report.hit %}
            <div style="margin-bottom:12px">
                <b>{{ item.title }}</b> <span class="badge badge-up">黑马</span>
                <div class="meta" style="margin-top:4px">{{ item.reason }}</div>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>

        <!-- 4. 商业数据 -->
        <div class="card">
            <h2>📦 销量与商业数据</h2>
            <table>
                <thead><tr><th>类别</th><th>内容</th><th>趋势</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                {% for row in report.sales %}
                <tr>
                    <td><b>{{ row.category }}</b></td>
                    <td>{{ row.content }}</td>
                    <td>
                        {% if row.trend == 'up' %}<span class="badge badge-up">↑ 上升</span>
                        {% elif row.trend == 'down' %}<span class="badge badge-down">↓ 下降</span>
                        {% else %}<span class="badge badge-flat">→ 持平</span>{% endif %}
                    </td>
                </tr>
                {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        <!-- 5. 制作公司 -->
        <div class="card">
            <h2>🏢 活跃动画制作公司</h2>
            {% for s in report.studios %}
            <span class="studio-chip">{{ s }}</span>
            {% else %}
            <div class="meta">暂无可用数据</div>
            {% endfor %}
            <div class="meta" style="margin-top:12px">以上为本季在播作品主要制作公司（基于真实数据），可关注其后续企划动态。</div>
        </div>

        <!-- 6. 类型分布 -->
        <div class="card">
            <h2>🎨 本季题材分布</h2>
            {% for g in report.genres %}
            <span class="studio-chip" style="background:#fef3c7;color:#92400e">{{ g }}</span>
            {% else %}
            <div class="meta">暂无可用数据</div>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 今日金句 -->
    <div class="card" style="margin-top:20px">
        <h2>💬 今日动漫金句</h2>
        <div class="quote">
            <div class="meta">{{ report.quote.source }} · {{ report.quote.character }}</div>
            <div class="line">“{{ report.quote.line }}”</div>
            <div class="meta">{{ report.quote.meaning }}</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        📊 Data Source：{{ report.source }} | 🤖 分析由 Nekomini Bot LLM 基于当日真实数据生成
        <br>📅 {{ generated_at }}（北京时间 UTC+8）<br>power by Nekomini
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>